      "description": {
        "fun": "Gastly is 95% poisonous gas, which makes it one of the lightest Pokémon there is, and it gives off a faint, sweet smell. Its gas can wrap around an enemy of any size and knock it out. Strong winds make it dwindle away, so groups of Gastly huddle together under the eaves of houses to shelter from the breeze.",
        "guide": "A Ghost and Poison Pokémon made almost entirely of poisonous gas, appearing as a dark sphere wrapped in a purple haze. It haunts old buildings and comes out at night, and strong winds can blow it away. It evolves into Haunter and then Gengar.",
        "tagline": "A sweet-smelling puff of poison gas with a grin",
        "sources": [
