      "description": {
        "fun": "Haunter fears the light, so it hides in dark places and slips through walls. If anyone comes near, it floats after them, beckoning them closer, then licks them with its gassy tongue, which sends them into convulsions. Its Japanese name is simply Ghost, the same word the Japanese games use for the Ghost type.",
        "guide": "The middle stage of Gastly's line, a gaseous Ghost and Poison Pokémon with a spiky head and two disembodied, floating hands. It hides in darkness, can pass through walls and attacks with a long tongue. It evolves into Gengar when traded or with a Linking Cord.",
        "tagline": "A floating grin with free-floating hands and a dangerous lick",
