        "zh-Hant": "耿鬼"
      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Gengar hides perfectly in shadows and loves playing tricks: one favourite is posing as someone's shadow on a full-moon night, then moving on its own and delighting in their fright. Its body soaks up heat, so the air turns about 5°C colder when it's near. Some Pokédex entries even claim it was once a human. Treat it well, though, and it can be a loyal partner.",
        "guide": "The final stage of Gastly's line, a dark purple Ghost and Poison Pokémon with a wide grin, red eyes and a spiky back. It hides in shadows, lowers the temperature around it and enjoys playing pranks and casting curses. It evolves from Haunter when traded, can Mega Evolve into Mega Gengar and has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A grinning shadow that chills the room",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Gengar (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Gengar_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
